  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**카드 번호 자동 포커스 이동 동작이 빠져 있습니다.**\n\n분할 입력 UX 요구사항(자동 포커스)에 해당하는 로직이 없어 4자리 입력 후 다음 칸으로 이동하지 않습니다.  \n \n\n<details>\n<summary>수정 방향 예시</summary>\n\n```diff\n-import { useState, useContext } from \"react\";\n+import { useState, useContext, useRef } from \"react\";\n@@\n export function CardNumberInput() {\n   const { cardNumber, setCardNumber, setNetworkBrand } =\n     useContext(CardContext);\n+  const inputRefs = useRef<Record<string, HTMLInputElement | null>>({\n+    \"first-digits\": null,\n+    \"second-digits\": null,\n+    \"third-digits\": null,\n+    \"fourth-digits\": null,\n+  });\n+  const nextInput: Record<string, string | null> = {\n+    \"first-digits\": \"second-digits\",\n+    \"second-digits\": \"third-digits\",\n+    \"third-digits\": \"fourth-digits\",\n+    \"fourth-digits\": null,\n+  };\n@@\n   const changeCardNumber = (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\n     const { value, id } = e.target;\n@@\n       setCardNumber({ ...cardNumber, [id]: value });\n+      if (value.length === e.target.maxLength) {\n+        const nextId = nextInput[id];\n+        if (nextId) inputRefs.current[nextId]?.focus();\n+      }\n@@\n   const changeFirstDigitsCardNumber = (\n     e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>,\n   ) => {\n     const { value, id } = e.target;\n@@\n       handleNetworkBrand(value);\n       setCardNumber({ ...cardNumber, [id]: value });\n+      if (value.length === e.target.maxLength) {\n+        inputRefs.current[\"second-digits\"]?.focus();\n+      }\n@@\n         <CardInput\n           id=\"first-digits\"\n+          ref={(el) => { inputRefs.current[\"first-digits\"] = el; }}\n@@\n         <CardInput\n           id=\"second-digits\"\n+          ref={(el) => { inputRefs.current[\"second-digits\"] = el; }}\n@@\n         <CardInput\n           id=\"third-digits\"\n+          ref={(el) => { inputRefs.current[\"third-digits\"] = el; }}\n@@\n         <CardInput\n           id=\"fourth-digits\"\n+          ref={(el) => { inputRefs.current[\"fourth-digits\"] = el; }}\n```\n</details>\n\n\nAlso applies to: 87-134\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@app/src/components/form/CardNumberInput.tsx` around lines 39 - 72, The\nchangeCardNumber and changeFirstDigitsCardNumber handlers lack the auto-focus\nbehavior for the split card inputs; after validating and calling setCardNumber\n(and handleNetworkBrand in changeFirstDigitsCardNumber), move focus to the next\ninput when the current value reaches its expected length (e.g., 4 digits).\nImplement focus transfer by querying the next input element (using id or a\npredictable input order) and calling .focus(), ensuring you only do this after\nsuccessful validation and state update; apply the same change to the other\ncard-digit handlers referenced around lines 87-134 so all segments auto-advance\nconsistently.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk:85b83c9d-e177-4bab-ab09-17737c4f52da -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
