  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**숫자 검증이 “숫자만 입력” 요구를 완전히 보장하지 못합니다.**\n\n`Number(value)` 기반 체크는 `\"1e2\"`, `\"+\"`, 공백 같은 값을 통과시킬 수 있습니다. 실제 입력/붙여넣기 케이스로 `Validator.isNumber`를 다시 확인해 보시고, “숫자 문자만 허용” 기준으로 검증 조건을 좁혀 주세요.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@app/src/validators/CardValidator.ts` around lines 2 - 5, The isNumber method\ncurrently uses Number(value) which accepts inputs like \"1e2\", \"+\", or\nwhitespace; change isNumber in CardValidator.ts to validate against a strict\ndigits-only pattern (e.g., match against /^\\d+$/) so only characters 0–9 are\naccepted, and keep throwing the existing error message when the regex does not\nmatch; ensure you trim input first to reject whitespace-only strings and handle\nempty input as invalid.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk:a6a7d778-f54a-4c07-b8c4-fb36327d06fe -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
